{"Title":"An Act commuter rail expansion","BillNumber":"H3321","DocketNumber":"HD1846","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T19:37:20.327"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"CMG1","Name":"Colleen M. Garry","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/CMG1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-18T19:37:20.3266667"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3321/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Garry of Dracut, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3321) of Colleen M. Garry relative to commuter rail expansion.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSECTION 1. Section 3 of Chapter 6C of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2020 Official Edition, is hereby amended by adding at the end of line 294 after the word “and” the following words: “no commuter rail expansion shall be planned without approval of the governing body of the communities the expansion will travel through.\"\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}